        '6-8', $q$A Sport Without Referees$q$, $q$(1) Ultimate is a team sport played with a flying disc on a long field. (2) Two teams of seven players try to score by catching the disc in the opposing end zone. (3) A player who catches the disc must stop running and pass it within ten seconds. (4) ____, if a pass is dropped or knocked down, the other team takes over. (5) What makes ultimate truly unusual, though, is the way games are judged.

