insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('62392d98-87a5-55b9-91b5-1a490e30a0f4', 'wg7-paragraph-transitions-p06', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g7-paragraph-transitions'), null,
        '6-8', $q$Our Clay Turtle Film$q$, $q$(1) For our art unit, my group made a one-minute stop-motion film about a clay turtle who wins a race. (2) First, we sketched a storyboard that showed each scene in a small box. (3) Then we shaped a turtle and a rabbit out of modeling clay. (4) Once the characters were ready, we set up a tablet on a stand so the camera would not move. (5) After that, we moved the clay figures a tiny bit and snapped a photo, over and over. (6) It took twelve photos to make just one second of film.

(7) Making the film was harder than we expected. (8) Our first attempt looked jumpy because someone bumped the table between shots. (9) ____, we taped the table legs to the floor and started that scene over. (10) The rabbit's long ears also kept drooping, so we hid toothpicks inside to hold them up. (11) When we finally played the finished film for the class, everyone cheered for the turtle.$q$, 'draft')
