   $q$Read: "Students must return their signed permission slips by Friday. ____, they will not be able to go on the museum trip." Which transition best completes the sentences?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Nevertheless,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contrast-for-condition"},{"text":"Consequently,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"cause-for-condition"},{"text":"Otherwise,","is_correct":true},{"text":"Likewise,","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"similarity-for-condition"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Otherwise,$q$, $q$"Otherwise" means "if they do not," which explains what happens to students who miss the deadline. "Consequently" is tempting, but it would mean that returning the slip causes students to miss the trip, which is the opposite of the meaning.$q$, 'draft', null)
