   $q$Read: "Volunteers at the river cleanup collected forty bags of trash. They also planted sixty young trees along the bank. A group of students tested the water and posted the results online." Which topic sentence best introduces these details?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Rivers are important to many communities.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-broad"},{"text":"Volunteering is more fun than spending the day indoors.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opinion-off-focus"},{"text":"The river cleanup day included several projects to help the river.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Volunteers picked up forty bags of trash from the river.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The river cleanup day included several projects to help the river.$q$, $q$Collecting trash, planting trees, and testing water are all projects from the same cleanup day, so this sentence covers every detail. "Rivers are important to many communities" is too broad because it does not mention the cleanup at all.$q$, 'draft', null)
